    {"type":"text","id":"ev3_t","x":1258,"y":974,"width":540,"height":275,"text":"// example: post-tool sees `cat data.csv` returning rows.\n// detect_struct_extension(\"data.csv\") → Mode::Csv\n// redact_csv() preserves header, masks row 2, drops rest.\n\n// stdin payload:\n{\n  \"tool_name\": \"Bash\",\n  \"tool_input\":   { \"command\": \"redactor wrap -- cat data.csv\" },\n  \"tool_response\":{ \"stdout\":  \"name,iban\\nAlice,DE89...\\nBob,DE12...\" }\n}\n\n// stdout (block, sanitized in reason):\n{\n  \"decision\": \"block\",\n  \"reason\":\n    \"redactor post-tool: tool output (Bash, mode=csv) was\n     sanitized — structure preserved, sensitive values masked.\n     ----- BEGIN SANITIZED OUTPUT -----\n     name,iban\n     <redacted>,<redacted>\n     ----- END SANITIZED OUTPUT -----\"\n}","originalText":"// example: post-tool sees `cat data.csv` returning rows.\n// detect_struct_extension(\"data.csv\") → Mode::Csv\n// redact_csv() preserves header, masks row 2, drops rest.\n\n// stdin payload:\n{\n  \"tool_name\": \"Bash\",\n  \"tool_input\":   { \"command\": \"redactor wrap -- cat data.csv\" },\n  \"tool_response\":{ \"stdout\":  \"name,iban\\nAlice,DE89...\\nBob,DE12...\" }\n}\n\n// stdout (block, sanitized in reason):\n{\n  \"decision\": \"block\",\n  \"reason\":\n    \"redactor post-tool: tool output (Bash, mode=csv) was\n     sanitized — structure preserved, sensitive values masked.\n     ----- BEGIN SANITIZED OUTPUT -----\n     name,iban\n     <redacted>,<redacted>\n     ----- END SANITIZED OUTPUT -----\"\n}","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#22c55e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":700032,"version":1,"versionNonce":700033,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"ev3","lineHeight":1.25},
