    {"type":"text","id":"footer","x":60,"y":1320,"width":2280,"height":40,"text":"settings.json wires four hook commands.  All four read tool_input/prompt JSON from stdin.  All four write either {} or {\"decision\":\"block\",\"reason\":\"…\"} to stdout.\n+ optional `redactor hook session-start` (best-effort audit log) and `redactor hook post-write` (PostToolUse Write|Edit — JSON/TOML syntax check).","originalText":"settings.json wires four hook commands.  All four read tool_input/prompt JSON from stdin.  All four write either {} or {\"decision\":\"block\",\"reason\":\"…\"} to stdout.\n+ optional `redactor hook session-start` (best-effort audit log) and `redactor hook post-write` (PostToolUse Write|Edit — JSON/TOML syntax check).","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":800001,"version":1,"versionNonce":800002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
